<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#2563eb">
  <title>Offline · <%= school.schoolName %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="offline-body">
  <div class="offline-card">
    <img src="/icons/icon-192.png" alt="<%= school.schoolName %>" class="offline-logo">
    <h1>📴 You are offline</h1>
    <p>No internet connection. Turn on mobile data or Wi-Fi and try again.</p>
    <p class="offline-hint">Results, timetable, fees and school messages all come back the moment you are connected. Your child's data is safe.</p>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-block" onclick="location.reload()">🔄 Try again</button>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
